OL,3,AThousands demand end to violence in
OL,4,AMexican cartel hotspot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have taken to the
OL,7,Fstreets of Culiacan to demand an end to
OL,8,Fthe violence that has wracked the city
OL,9,Fin northern Mexico.
OL,11,FThe state of Sinaloa has seen the
OL,12,Fnumber of murders and disappearances
OL,13,Fskyrocket since two factions of the
OL,14,FSinaloa cartel started a bloody war two
OL,15,Fyears ago.
OL,17,FResidents dressed in white held up
OL,18,Fposters of missing loved ones and signs
OL,19,Freading "We don't want fear, we want
OL,20,Fpeace" at the protest on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
